{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Third valid post-static-corpus Gerrit Verify sample: run 31843821793 passed in 1,992s overall; Verified job completed 1,991s after creation. Combined with prior valid samples 1,778s and 2,060s, N=3 mean time to vote-job completion is 1,943s = 32m23s (median 1,991s = 33m11s), still above the 20-30m target. This sample had macOS default 1,588.59s and integration 191.56s. The only individual pytest phase above 30s anywhere was macOS editor loopback setup at 35.13s; no Ubuntu individual test exceeded 30s. Selected mutation shards consumed 2,824 runner-seconds (~47.1 runner-minutes) but all finished more than 14 minutes before the vote, so their direct completion-path contribution was zero in this run while their contention cost remains material. Change 1792 (4cbaa19315) merged the cancellation repair; live cancellation savings await the first organic superseding patchset."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786746048079633001,"uuid":"5bb959a6-79ea-4347-8755-bb3b452aa843"}